{"operations":[{"content":"# Summary\n\nThe charter states that each member pays a yearly contribution. The amount a member pays each year is fixed in the annex of the charter. [[cite:obs-100eeca0b50dbc0e12554454da1a554ad7ed5de6 \"Each member pays a yearly contribution; the amount is fixed in the annex of this charter.\"]]\n\nThe annex specifies that the ordinary contributions are one hundred twenty (120) EUR, payable within January. [[cite:obs-48a7f41379555f1fdd6d44585a76108ba87e7467 \"Ordinary contributions: one hundred twenty (120) EUR, payable within January.\"]]\n","expected_sha256":"7455d0af2794224e01b3a8350bdb060e587561c702891cd7de4c977727ead6bc","kind":"modify","path":"doc/summary.md"}],"rationale":"Added explicit statements about the membership fee and the exact amount paid yearly, each followed by exact citations from the charter and annex sources as required."}